  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTPS: Fix PSK flag placement in PID_PARTICIPANT_SECURITY_INFO",
  "description": "psk_encrypted (bit 6) was in PARTICIPANT_SECURITY_INFO_FLAGS (the\ngeneral mask) instead of PLUGIN_PARTICIPANT_SECURITY_INFO_FLAGS (the\nplugin mask). psk_protected (bit 4) was missing from\nPARTICIPANT_SECURITY_INFO_FLAGS entirely. Both flags displayed as\n\"Not set\" even when their respective bits were set in the wire data.\n\nAlso rename hf_rtps_flag_participant_security_attribute_flag_key_psk_protected\nto hf_rtps_flag_participant_security_attribute_flag_is_psk_protected to\nmatch the naming convention used by sibling flags.\n\nAI-Assisted: yes (Copilot)",
  "state": "merged",
